# Optional: enables the AI fallback that reads product pages when the
# structured-data parsers cannot find dimensions.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: enables the photoreal tour — renders a 360° panorama of each room
# and has an image model repaint it as a photograph, which you then walk
# through. Either key works; set whichever account you can get billed. Without
# one the button still builds a navigable tour from the raw 3D panoramas, and a
# user can supply their own key in Settings → AI instead.
#
# Gemini 3 Pro Image: true 4K and the stronger geometry-preserver, but it has
# no 2:1 aspect ratio, so the panorama round-trips through 21:9. ~$0.24/room.
# NOTE: image generation has NO free tier — a key on an unbilled project
# reports `limit: 0` and every request 429s.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# OpenAI gpt-image-2: takes arbitrary sizes, so 3840x1920 is a native 2:1 and
# nothing gets squashed — at a lower resolution ceiling. ~$0.41/room at high
# quality. Requires organisation verification (Persona ID) on top of billing;
# without it the API 403s with "must be verified".
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional: enables "Make 3D" on custom items — generates a real 3D model
# from the item photo via Tripo (https://platform.tripo3d.ai). ~$0.40-0.50
# per generation. Without it the button is hidden and items render as
# correctly-sized boxes.
TRIPO_API_KEY=
